      "message": "As per the documentation in https://www.consul.io/docs/agent/http/catalog.html#catalog_service, it suggests otherwise.\nTo quote it .. \"Adding the optional ?near\u003d parameter with a node name will sort the node list in ascending order based on the estimated round trip time from that node. Passing ?near\u003d_agent will use the agent\u0027s node for the sort.\".\nThis link https://python-consul.readthedocs.io/en/latest/#consul.base.Consul.Catalog.service is for python consul catalog service.",
