      "writtenOn": "2017-03-02T01:49:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually you need to be careful how you read the doc. Here, a node represents a consul agent of a consul cluster, ie. a node of the consul cluster. This means that if you pass in a host which is not a consul agent you will get a shuffled response. This is not what is desired here.",
      "parentUuid": "da141535_026db032",
      "revId": "94d3835730a8183403dcd000894ec4d8db46aa58",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
